ing miniature components, and a pale gray dustproof tray. Several gears, screws, and red jewel bearings are arranged neatly on an ivory antistatic work mat rather than scattered randomly. An articulated brass task lamp on the left casts a warm, concentrated beam onto the exposed movement, producing controlled reflections across polished steel, brushed metal, brass wheels, and the edge of the glass. On the right side of the workbench stand a compact precision testing instrument and a deep green glass display dome containing another complex mechanical movement. The background is an architecturally refined watchmaking atelier composed of dark wood panels, frosted metal frames, and transparent glass cabinets arranged in clean geometric lines. A small selection of watches, movement models, and specialist tools appears inside the softly blurred cabinets, with no recognizable brand marks or readable text. A large window on the rear left introduces cool natural daylight, creating a restrained contrast with the warm task lamp. Foreground tools, the woman and wristwatch in the middle ground, and the glass cabinets in the background form three clearly separated spatial layers. Focus rests on her visible eye, the tip of the tweezers, and the intricate watch movement, while the studio gradually softens into the background without losing its architectural structure. The deep slate blue, walnut brown, brass gold, and ivory palette, together with precise composition, realistic materials, and controlled lighting, creates a quiet, luxurious, professional, and cinematic atmosphere of elite mechanical watchmaking.", "", 1024], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 673, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "images.image_1", "label": "images.image_1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image_1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "vae", "label": "vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt"